    Kp9
enum Mouse: Left Right Middle Back Forward
enum Pad: A B X Y Back Start LB RB Up Down Left Right
enum Axis: LeftX LeftY RightX RightY LT RT
struct FrameStats: draws tris frameMs cpuMs sceneMs shadowMs cameraMs uiMs
struct TextMode: tabular letterSp wordSp shaped
struct Finger: id x y down held up
struct ContextHints: depth stencil samples debug
